`,(0,n.jsxs)(r.li,{children:[(0,n.jsx)(r.strong,{children:"You're researching a new market,"})," scoping competitors, evaluating tools. For any research that might span multiple tabs with hard to extract information, Cowork visits the sites, reads the reports, pulls the pricing, and delivers a structured brief with sources, without you opening a single browser tab."]}),`
`,(0,n.jsxs)(r.li,{children:[(0,n.jsx)(r.strong,{children:"You need to parse through large documents"})," where the details matter: contracts, financial reports, meeting transcripts. Cowork reads every page, cross-references across the full set, and pulls out the patterns that only emerge from reading all of them. Review fifty like you'd review five."]}),`
