`,(0,n.jsxs)(r.p,{children:[(0,n.jsx)(r.strong,{children:"Remote"}),": You connect a GitHub repository and Claude works in a cloud environment. Sessions continue even if you close the app, so you can start a big refactor and check back later. Good for larger codebases or when you want to keep development off your local machine."]}),`
